# samples/11-Observability – start it with: dotnet run --project samples/11-Observability – and watch its console
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5111

### outcome "processed"
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/Ada

### outcome "rejected" – layer "constraints"
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "nope", "quantity": 2 }

### outcome "rejected" – layer "rules"
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "ANV-1", "quantity": 50 }

### outcome "processed", 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "ANV-1", "quantity": 2 }

### processor.duration – a 1.2 s processor span
GET {{baseUrl}}/work?ms=1200

### outcome "error" – the errors counter, spans with status Error, a 500 problem
GET {{baseUrl}}/boom
